WEBVTT

00:47:59.750 --> 00:48:01.768
on self-reliance?

00:48:01.792 --> 00:48:05.101
And how many of you would say
the focus was on loyalty?

00:48:05.125 --> 00:48:08.101
And how many of the people here
who highlighted loyalty

00:48:08.125 --> 00:48:09.542
are not American-born?

00:48:10.125 --> 00:48:11.375
OK.
AG: A lot.

00:48:12.125 --> 00:48:16.809
EP: You see that you live
in the Mecca of individualism here.

00:48:16.833 --> 00:48:18.101
AG: We do.

00:48:18.125 --> 00:48:21.059
EP: And so that notion is, I think,

00:48:21.083 --> 00:48:23.559
what draws a lot of people
to come here as well,

00:48:23.583 --> 00:48:26.226
is that for once
I can actually prove myself,

00:48:26.250 --> 00:48:27.851
do my own thing.

00:48:27.875 --> 00:48:29.184
That is not an either or,

00:48:29.208 --> 00:48:34.226
I think there's beauty and value
in each of these models.